","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/f/f1/Ce8e5562.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20220831030020","caption":"Из альбома «My Friend» · № 16","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/f/f1/Ce8e5562.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20220831030020"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:9f9a72e2.jpg","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/2/27/9f9a72e2.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20220831030746","caption":"Из альбома «My Friend» · № 17","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/2/27/9f9a72e2.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20220831030746"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:624fbe69.jpg","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/6/6a/624fbe69.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20220831030757","caption":"Из альбома «My Friend» · № 18","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/6/6a/624fbe69.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20220831030757"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:0b0a283a.jpg","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/1/11/0b0a283a.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20220831030807","caption":"Из альбома «My Friend» · № 19","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/1/11/0b0a283a.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20220831030807"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:48cc9797.jpg","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/f/f8/48cc9797.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20220831030817","caption":"Из альбома «My Friend» · № 20","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/f/f8/48cc9797.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20220831030817"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:FNo3LPdUYAQMqJg.jpg","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/9/99/FNo3LPdUYAQMqJg.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20220821035627","caption":"Из альбома «My Friend» · № 21","large":